WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.592 --> 00:00:04.973
Wukong plucked a peach from a branch and bit into it.

2
00:00:04.993 --> 00:00:08.214
"This peach tastes wonderful!"

3
00:00:11.075 --> 00:00:13.535
he said.

4
00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:33.033
ate another peach.

5
00:00:34.594 --> 00:00:36.236
And then he ate another one.

6
00:00:40.639 --> 00:00:45.463
Each morning after that, Wukong secretly ate more and more peaches.

7
00:00:49.506 --> 00:00:52.529
After eating he climbed into a tree and took a nap.

8
00:00:53.649 --> 00:00:57.232
Time went by, and Wukong enjoyed his life in Heaven.

9
00:00:59.194 --> 00:01:01.576
Meanwhile the queen of Heaven was busy.

10
00:01:02.676 --> 00:01:05.639
It was almost time for the annual Peach Festival.

11
00:01:09.222 --> 00:01:12.524
She called for her maidens, Red Gown and Blue Gown.

12
00:01:12.544 --> 00:01:15.987
"How may we help you?"

13
00:01:16.387 --> 00:01:17.208
asked Red Gown.

14
00:01:17.228 --> 00:01:21.171
"The Peach Festival is tomorrow," said the queen.

15
00:01:21.191 --> 00:01:25.715
"All the important gods and spirits in Heaven will be here.

16
00:01:27.116 --> 00:01:31.400
I also invited the bodhisattva Guanyin, the goddess of mercy.

17
00:01:32.488 --> 00:01:36.451
Go to the Peach Garden now, and pick plenty of ripe peaches."

18
00:01:41.054 --> 00:01:43.436
Red Gown and Blue Gown went to the garden.

19
00:01:44.977 --> 00:01:48.660
As soon as they went through the gate, both maidens gasped.

20
00:01:56.225 --> 00:01:57.686
"Where are all the peaches?"

21
00:01:58.086 --> 00:02:01.112
cried Red Gown.

22
00:02:01.132 --> 00:02:01.493
"They're gone!"

23
00:02:01.813 --> 00:02:02.653
cried Blue Gown.

24
00:02:04.875 --> 00:02:05.896
is terrible!"

25
00:02:06.276 --> 00:02:07.136
said Red Gown.

26
00:02:07.156 --> 00:02:09.638
"The queen will be angry!"

27
00:02:11.199 --> 00:02:13.521
Wukong had been sleeping up on a branch.

28
00:02:14.581 --> 00:02:16.403
When he heard the maidens, he woke up.

29
00:02:19.225 --> 00:02:20.646
making all this noise?"

30
00:02:20.986 --> 00:02:23.107
he asked, jumping down to the ground.

31
00:02:25.729 --> 00:02:27.150
"I'm trying to sleep!"

32
00:02:28.771 --> 00:02:29.872
maidens were startled.

33
00:02:30.456 --> 00:02:33.397
"We're sorry to wake you, sir," said Red Gown.

34
00:02:34.238 --> 00:02:36.839
"We came to pick peaches for the Peach Festival.

35
00:02:37.979 --> 00:02:41.601
Do you know what happened to—" Peach Festival?"

36
00:02:41.941 --> 00:02:42.661
said Wukong.

37
00:02:43.661 --> 00:02:44.582
His eyes lit up.

38
00:02:44.662 --> 00:02:46.363
"I didn't hear about that."

39
00:02:47.323 --> 00:02:50.544
"Oh, it's a wonderful festival," said Blue Gown.

40
00:02:50.564 --> 00:02:54.206
"All the important gods and spirits will be there."

41
00:02:55.626 --> 00:02:57.347
sounds like fun," said Wukong.

42
00:02:57.367 --> 00:03:01.060
"I'm sure I'm invited, right?"

43
00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.361
Gown bit her lip.

44
00:03:02.381 --> 00:03:05.602
"Um, I don't think so."

45
00:03:08.083 --> 00:03:08.923
was furious.

46
00:03:08.943 --> 00:03:11.865
"The queen did not invite me?

47
00:03:12.905 --> 00:03:15.386
I'm just as important as any other spirit or god!"

48
00:03:17.207 --> 00:03:18.507
The maidens looked nervous.

49
00:03:18.527 --> 00:03:21.068
"Sir," said Blue Gown.

50
00:03:21.088 --> 00:03:23.409
"Where are the peaches?"

51
00:03:23.429 --> 00:03:27.031
"I ate them," said Wukong.

52
00:03:28.031 --> 00:03:29.212
ate every single one!

53
00:03:29.564 --> 00:03:31.005
And they were delicious!"

54
00:03:32.226 --> 00:03:32.826
"Oh no!"

55
00:03:33.147 --> 00:03:33.987
cried Red Gown.

56
00:03:34.007 --> 00:03:36.329
"We must tell the queen."

57
00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:41.432
"No, you're not going to tell the queen," said Wukong.

58
00:03:42.313 --> 00:03:43.534
quickly said a spell.

59
00:03:44.294 --> 00:03:47.557
Instantly Red Gown and Blue Gown fell asleep.

60
00:03:50.038 --> 00:03:52.820
Wukong looked at all the empty peach trees.

61
00:03:55.162 --> 00:03:55.782
shook his head.

62
00:03:55.802 --> 00:04:01.316
"I'm in big trouble."

63
00:04:01.396 --> 00:04:05.398
When Red Gown and Blue Gown woke up, they ran back to the Cloud Palace.

64
00:04:05.418 --> 00:04:08.559
"Your Majesty!"

65
00:04:08.859 --> 00:04:09.680
cried Red Gown.

66
00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:12.741
terrible has happened!

67
00:04:14.001 --> 00:04:16.142
Sun Wukong ate all the peaches!"

68
00:04:16.222 --> 00:04:21.845
"He got very angry and cast a spell on us," added Blue Gown.

69
00:04:21.865 --> 00:04:24.886
"When we woke up, he was gone."

70
00:04:27.067 --> 00:04:29.328
The queen's eyes flashed with anger.

71
00:04:33.384 --> 00:04:36.267
She went to the royal court and told the Jade Emperor.

72
00:04:37.828 --> 00:04:38.709
horrible monkey!"

73
00:04:39.069 --> 00:04:39.870
cried the emperor.

74
00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:43.072
He turned to his captain.

75
00:04:43.953 --> 00:04:44.934
100,000 soldiers.

76
00:04:45.755 --> 00:04:47.236
I want Wukong arrested!"

77
00:04:48.437 --> 00:04:50.779
The captain nodded and then left the palace.

78
00:04:53.281 --> 00:04:59.767
Meanwhile the bodhisattva Guanyin left her home on Mount Potalaka in the South Sea.

79
00:05:01.556 --> 00:05:03.637
She soon arrived at the Cloud Palace.

80
00:05:03.657 --> 00:05:08.500
"I'm sorry to tell you this," said the queen.

81
00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:12.082
"But there won't be a peach festival."

82
00:05:12.102 --> 00:05:14.304
"Why not?"

83
00:05:14.764 --> 00:05:15.604
asked Guanyin.

84
00:05:15.624 --> 00:05:21.068
"A monkey named Sun Wukong ate all the peaches," said the emperor.

85
00:05:21.088 --> 00:05:24.990
"I sent 100,000 soldiers to arrest him.

86
00:05:25.971 --> 00:05:28.032
They'll bring him back to Heaven soon."

87
00:05:29.236 --> 00:05:32.139
Just then a messenger ran into the court.

88
00:05:32.159 --> 00:05:34.902
"We need more soldiers, Your Majesty!"

89
00:05:34.922 --> 00:05:37.384
"What?" cried the emperor.

90
00:05:37.404 --> 00:05:41.889
"Wukong defeated the entire army," said the messenger.

91
00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:45.472
The Jade Emperor put his head in his hands.

92
00:05:46.633 --> 00:05:48.776
"We don't have any more soldiers!"
